  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> Smartgun Link and Smart Rebuild Attachments</p>\n<p><em>Some smartlinks utilize sophisticated movement-predictive-technology.</em></p>\n<p>The weapon no longer gains a +1 to Attack Checks from the modified attachment. In return, if the weapon is wielded or drawn during the first Round of Combat, the user’s current Initiative is increased by 2. This Initiative increase lasts as long as the weapon remains wielded and is being actively utilized (e.g., just holding it at your side doesn’t count). If the weapon is stowed or knocked out of the user’s hand, their Initiative decreases by the appropriate amount.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Attachment Mods).</em></p>"
